<title>UK: Northern Rock B/S sets 150 million stg 25-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Northern Rock B/S sets 150 million stg 25-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by sole manager Merrill Lynch International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORTHERN ROCK BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     9.375     MATURITY    17.OCT.21</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.316    PAY DATE    17.OCT.96</p>
